---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';

const title = "Payment Setup — Travel Guide";
const description = "Digital wallets, physical cards, and pre-arrival financial readiness for international travel.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": title,
  "description": description,
  "url": `${SITE.url}/guides/payment-setup`
};
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <article class="py-20 lg:py-32">
    <Container>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <nav class="mb-12">
          <a href="/guides" class="eyebrow text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            ← All guides
          </a>
        </nav>

        <header class="mb-16">
          <span class="eyebrow mb-4 inline-block">Chapter 03</span>
          <h1 class="text-h1 font-serif font-light mb-8">Payment & Financial Setup</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Arriving in a new economy requires a diversified approach to payments. Relying on a single card or method is a common pitfall for the modern traveler.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">
            <div class="bg-surface p-8 border border-border">
              <h4 class="eyebrow mb-4">Digital Wallets</h4>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed m-0">Ensure Apple Pay or Google Pay is configured with multiple cards from different banks. This is the primary payment method in most urban hubs globally.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface p-8 border border-border">
              <h4 class="eyebrow mb-4">Physical Cards</h4>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed m-0">Always carry at least one physical Visa and one Mastercard. Inform your bank of your travel dates to prevent automated fraud blocks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-16 mb-8">Pre-Arrival Readiness</h2>
          <p>Download the local banking or digital payment app (like WeChat Pay or KakaoPay) and complete the verification process before you leave. Many systems require a one-time password (OTP) sent to your home phone number, which can be difficult to receive once you've swapped SIM cards or lost signal.</p>

          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-16 mb-8">The Cash Reserve</h2>
          <p>While most urban environments are leaning towards cashless transactions, many specialized services—traditional markets, small street vendors, or rural transit—still require local currency. Aim to carry the equivalent of $50–$100 in local cash as an emergency buffer.</p>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-20 pt-20 border-t border-border flex justify-between items-center">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="eyebrow text-muted-foreground mb-2">Previous</span>
            <a href="/guides/visa-entry" class="text-lg font-serif hover:text-primary transition-colors">← Visa & Entry Information</a>
          </div>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
